<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's foreign exchange market is closed on Thursday due to a national holiday. It will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the Taiwan dollar closed at T$27.538 to the U.S. dollar compared to Tuesday's T$27.545 close. Turnover through dealers was an active US$275 million. -- Kevin Chen (5080815)</p>
